  "row_guide": "Band0 top: main school facade + clock tower + clock face. Mid: wall/corridor modular strips, zigzag entrance ramp, railing, twin flagpoles, plaza benches. Bottom: basketball courts (clean + overgrown + half sections), court line fragments, hoops, balls. Band1 top: stadium floodlights, wooden bleachers (+ low bench), basketball hoops. Mid: playground slides/swings/rings/forts/bridges/monkey bars/climbers/fence; soccer field + goals + balls. Bottom-left: yellow/blue/red modular tube tunnels (straights, junctions, endcaps). Bottom-right: gym vault boxes, bars, racks, hula hoops, mats, hurdles, balance beam, sandbox, climbing wall, PE cones/balls/ropes. Band2: playground bridge/bead set, bridge segment, railed platforms, activity panels; striped soccer pitch; soccer goal left/right pairs."
